#: lattice-gpui/src/typst.rs
msgid "Lattice compiles Typst with a component it downloads once. Until then, Typst files open with highlighting only. Settings › Editor & builds can remove it."
msgstr "Lattice 通过一个只需下载一次的组件编译 Typst。在此之前，Typst 文件只有语法高亮。可在“设置 › 编辑编译”中移除它。"

